SUMMARY:Deadline: Hessische Kulturstiftung: Reise- und Residenzstipendien 2
 027/2028 (18th round)
DESCRIPTION:Hesse's flagship stipend programme for visual artists: 14 grant
 s across two years\, split between free travel grants (3 to 12 months\, EU
 R 25\,000)\, residency grants at the foundation's studios in New York\, Lo
 ndon\, Paris\, Istanbul and Kyoto\, and two combined grants. Former recipi
 ents can access up to EUR 7\,700 in additional production funding. ELIGIBI
 LITY (strict): visual artists born in Hesse\, OR with primary residence in
  Hesse since 1 January 2025\, OR graduates of a Hessian art academy\; prev
 ious recipients are excluded. Apply via bewerberportal.hkst.de\; the porta
 l is open 1 August to 15 October 2026. DEADLINE: 15 October 2026.\n\nOrgan
 isation: Hessische Kulturstiftung\nLocation: Wiesbaden\, Germany (administ
 ration)\; residencies in New York\, London\, Paris\, Istanbul and Kyoto\, 
 or free travel. RESTRICTED: visual artists born in Hesse\, resident in Hes
 se since 1 January 2025\, or graduates of a Hessian art academy.\nAward: T
 ravel grants of EUR 25\,000 (3 to 12 months)\, plus access to up to EUR 7\
 ,700 additional production funding after the grant. 14 grants over two yea
 rs: 5 travel\, 7 residency (NYC\, London\, Paris\, Istanbul\, Kyoto)\, 2 c
 ombined. NOTE: figures are from the call text as republished verbatim by l
 isting sites\; the official funding-guidelines PDF was unavailable at the 
 time of adding\, so verify on hkst.de. No application fee.\nDuration: 3 to
  12 months\n\nMore: https://hkst.de/stipendien/?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://hkst.de/stipendien/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_m
 edium=referral
LOCATION:Wiesbaden\, Germany (administration)\; residencies in New York\, L
 ondon\, Paris\, Istanbul and Kyoto\, or free travel. RESTRICTED: visual ar
 tists born in Hesse\, resident in Hesse since 1 January 2025\, or graduate
 s of a Hessian art academy.
